f/gallery\n\nこの服を着せたいと思います。https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lUOaiXZF1riIR4dehVuencUjJxFCgjdI/view?usp=sharing\n\n彼女はとても優しそうで、微笑んでいて、庭のような平和なシーンで花を持っているかもしれません。\n\n以上です！ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/6182655.eef/gallery", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@youki_gdn/works/108", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b69716d8/uploads/origins/89958272-cf48-48e5-95f5-7fb957af1e87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=757f70cb28cc02112e58bd5690e0cb14", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b69716d8/uploads/origins/89958272-cf48-48e5-95f5-7fb957af1e87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=757f70cb28cc02112e58bd5690e0cb14, https://si.imgix.net/b69716d8/uploads/origins/89958272-cf48-48e5-95f5-7fb957af1e87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f434977aae7cfd9c36b1226a959dbb7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b69716d8/uploads/origins/89958272-cf48-48e5-95f5-7fb957af1e87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e1516400411b2f7b14b076e351b5a00 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your art is so wonderful. Would you please draw my original character?\n\n🪽 FAUST | \"35\" YEARS OLD | 178 CM\n› She is a \"cab driver\" who can only be requested by appointment. \n› In truth, her clients are not ordinary people in need of a taxi. Rather, they are hopeless people who have been driven into a corner. They have nowhere else to go, so they turn to her as a last resort. She is a cab driver on the outside, but is actually a talented assassin under wraps. She only helps those who she deems to be \"victims,\" and her clientele largely includes those escaping from violent situations, or those who are looking to get revenge on people who are powerful and otherwise difficult to touch.\n› Raised in the church as an orphan, despite her unconventional profession, she is a deeply religious person with her own personal sense of right and wrong. Though her methods can be cruel and twisted, to her, so long as she is protecting a \"lamb\" from a \"wolf,\" she would gladly become the slaughterer.\n› Hedonistic, confident, and charismatic. She lives unabashedly for herself. Her life is meaningless to her in the grand scheme of thing, and despite her faith, she does not believe in heaven or hell. So, she would like to spend her meager human life doing all that she can for the world before she departs.\n› Known in the underground community as \"the Reaper\" and the \"Angel of Death.\"\n\nAPPEARANCE: \n› She typically wears around blue sunglasses, and has her hair up in a ponytail. Her jewelry is silver. She likes to wear dark colors, like black and burgundy. Her style is very \"femme fatale.\"\n› Her hair is white, and her bangs have light blue ends that match her eyes. When down, her hair is straight and goes all the way to her knees.\n› Her eyes are a very pale blue. They have white crosses as pupils.\n› She has four beauty marks that form a line down her right eye.\n› She has scarring on her face that goes across her face and down and through her left eye. \n› She also has scars all over her torso. \n› She has white angel wing tattoos that cover her shoulders. They look like wings folding over her. \n\nQUIRKS:\n› She loves sweets and alcohol. \n› She has a soft spot for baby animals and people who remind her of baby animals.\n› Despite looking very cool and tough, she cries a lot over sad movies.\n› A bit of a slob. \n\nFaust is a modern-day \"Robin Hood\" with a darker twist. She does not mind getting her hands dirtied if it means freedom for someone else who has been oppressed. Her weapons of choice are a Rhino 60DS Nebula pistol, as well as a small hand-knife. \n\nComposition and pose are entirely up to you. Please feel free to turn down this request for any reason whatsoever. Thank you so much for your time and consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1W2mIu4hLv-eciIzxc2fJJz7xE9kdTaZg?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@youki_gdn/works/107", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/af97de39/uploads/origins/0af913a2-18ce-489c-b4ee-28702376c9e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d4a597c0f6bd5ebc7ff4fe9ebd611cf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/af97de39/uploads/origins/0af913a2-18ce-489c-b4ee-28702376c9e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d4a597c0f6bd5ebc7ff4fe9ebd611cf, https://si.imgix.net/af97de39/uploads/origins/0af913a2-18ce-489c-b4ee-28702376c9e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50e0df1fe488e79cbf3430c32bf39785 2x, https://si.imgix.net/af97de39/uploads/origins/0af913a2-18ce-489c-b4ee-28702376c9e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f276bedd0ce4debed09b4e3a50705671 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして\nえすと申します。\nYoukiさんのイラストはとてもかっこいいと思いますので、依頼させてください！\nキャラはTRPGの自キャラの魔剣士のエルフです。プロフィールなどは資料URLにてあります。\n設定的に、攻撃中みたいな構図がいいと思います。魔法も剣も使ったら幸いと思います。魔法の属性は雷属性の無属性の魔法です。\n\nよろしくおねがいします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ge2ouB25kpBIy9-Gccmf-iYbKzjBzN8g", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@youki_gdn/works/106", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5dcd63fb/uploads/origins/234646e3-4e08-4b23-b8e6-9ea03d0985e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2facbb56582d181fcda8cb8d9139e5e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5dcd63fb/uploads/origins/234646e3-4e08-4b23-b8e6-9ea03d0985e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2facbb56582d181fcda8cb8d9139e5e, https://si.imgix.net/5dcd63fb/uploads/origins/234646e3-4e08-4b23-b8e6-9ea03d0985e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=250cfd6baea6a01f07ebd53628868626 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5dcd63fb/uploads/origins/234646e3-4e08-4b23-b8e6-9ea03d0985e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=502fac0091ba0b7ebeb94d1e407192d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のocキャラクター、セドリックの依頼をお願いしたいのですが。\n\n彼は高貴な貴族の家に育ち、礼儀正しく、穏やかで礼儀正しい。彼は、王子様のようなオーラを放つ「超ハンサム」な男性で、その上、誰もがとろけるような優しい微笑みを浮かべています。銀色の髪（白髪）と銀青色の瞳、そして太いまつげが特徴。\n\n  彼の住む王国は氷の都である。  \n\n雪景色と水晶で覆われた風景の中で、氷の剣を構える彼の写真、またはファンタジーなヨーロッパの城のシーンをお願いしたい。\n\n [彼のシンボルであるスノードロップの花畑で飾ることもできる。］\n\n可能であれば、キャラクターのレイヤーを分けたいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1g1Cua5-MQnEnktxjkQpkb1g4eOT4RYk-", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@youki_gdn/works/105", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/888a048f/uploads/origins/03bcdbbe-e220-433b-b08e-7d146d845d2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a13856a589b6162fe1856b181d0310c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/888a048f/uploads/origins/03bcdbbe-e220-433b-b08e-7d146d845d2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a13856a589b6162fe1856b181d0310c, https://si.imgix.net/888a048f/uploads/origins/03bcdbbe-e220-433b-b08e-7d146d845d2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7057510f0177ebce02ee6895a212740b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/888a048f/uploads/origins/03bcdbbe-e220-433b-b08e-7d146d845d2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60411d69398f70bf012d650537501837 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "陽木先生、こんにちは、\n\n以前描いていただいた作品、とても気に入っています。\n\n今回はドラゴンのOCをお願いできますか？\n\nドラゴンの王子様です。\n\n好きなように描いてください。クールでハンサムに見えるかな？\nまた、3つのカラーパレットからどれを選ぶかも自由です。\n背景は中国風？\n\nまた、個人的な使用のために印刷する許可をお願いします。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\n彼のデザインはBlackbunii on Xです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SGQHBAyw_dJSYNtUE8eBqw78NdttWHoD", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@youki_gdn/works/104", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/28151541/uploads/origins/3a27d343-29ce-4325-9e3a-0d468d1fe453?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&cr